    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Set sail on an epic journey with Kaetram, the animated 2D MMORPG where your medieval fantasies come to life. Every corner of this vast world is a treasure chest of enigmas; each piece a part of a much larger story.<br><br>Equip your character with an array of exquisite items, showcasing your distinctive flair with heroic customization. Whether you wield the strength of a knight, the knowledge of a mage, or the precision of an archer, your character is yours to define.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716120/extras/064532e2a89c48bcab3f715c566f482b.poster.avif?t=1738765366\" width=600 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716120/extras/064532e2a89c48bcab3f715c566f482b.webm?t=1738765366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716120/extras/064532e2a89c48bcab3f715c566f482b.mp4?t=1738765366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Combat offers you a variety of ways to engage in battles with monsters, bosses and other players. You can utilize a variety of weapons, skills and armor to defeat your enemies, make your own choices to develop your offensive and defensive skills.<br><br>Embark on a multitude of adventures as you master life skills like lumberjacking, alchemy, mining, fishing and more!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716120/extras/2a488a7757e1025bbacaefd968079cec.poster.avif?t=1738765366\" width=600 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716120/extras/2a488a7757e1025bbacaefd968079cec.webm?t=1738765366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716120/extras/2a488a7757e1025bbacaefd968079cec.mp4?t=1738765366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
